{"title":"Career roadmap · Research Assistant","role":"Research Assistant","summary":"A Research Assistant in Biophysics / Biomedical Science supports research involving biological systems, physical principles, biomolecules, cells, biomedical technologies, imaging, instrumentation and quantitative data analysis.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Biophysics / Biomedical Science"},"about":[{"label":"Primary stack","text":"Biology + Physics + Mathematics + Laboratory Science + Scientific Computing"},{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Strong alignment. Build both wet-lab competence and quantitative/computational research skills."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc. Biophysics / Biomedical Science, this is a strongly aligned research-entry career. For long-term independent research or scientist positions, an M.Sc./M.Tech followed by a PhD is generally the stronger pathway."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build biology, physics, chemistry, mathematics, laboratory and computational research skills."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Enter as Research Assistant, Project Assistant, Research Technician or Junior Research Associate; pursue relevant postgraduate study where needed."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Complete/pursue PhD and progress toward Research Fellow, Biophysics Researcher or Biomedical Scientist."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Scientist, Principal Scientist, Research Lead, Faculty or Biomedical R&D leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Biology, chemistry, physics and mathematics fundamentals"},{"text":"NPTEL + university labs"},{"text":"Laboratory records"},{"text":"Scientific foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Cell biology, biochemistry and Python"},{"text":"NPTEL + Python"},{"text":"Biological-data project"},{"text":"Biology + computing"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Molecular biology, biophysics and statistics"},{"text":"University + research papers"},{"text":"Quantitative biology project"},{"text":"Research capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Microscopy, spectroscopy and biomedical instrumentation"},{"text":"Laboratory work"},{"text":"Imaging/spectroscopy analysis"},{"text":"Experimental skills"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Bioinformatics, computational biology and biomedical data"},{"text":"NCBI/EMBL-EBI + Python/R"},{"text":"Computational research project"},{"text":"Data capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Research internship"},{"text":"University/institute laboratory"},{"text":"Research report/poster"},{"text":"Research readiness"}],[{"text":"Final Year / Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced specialisation + dissertation"},{"text":"Research supervisor"},{"text":"Major research project"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Final Year / Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"M.Sc./research applications"},{"text":"Research preparation"},{"text":"Research CV + SOP"},{"text":"PG readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"h","text":"Biology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell Biology"},{"text":"Molecular Biology"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Physiology"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Developmental Biology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chemistry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Organic Chemistry"},{"text":"Physical Chemistry"},{"text":"Analytical Chemistry"},{"text":"Bioorganic Chemistry"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Physics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Classical Mechanics"},{"text":"Electromagnetism"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Statistical Physics"},{"text":"Quantum Mechanics"},{"text":"Optics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Biophysics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Molecular Biophysics"},{"text":"Structural Biology"},{"text":"Membrane Biophysics"},{"text":"Protein Biophysics"},{"text":"Biomechanics"},{"text":"Computational Biophysics"},{"text":"Systems Biology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Biomedical science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human Physiology"},{"text":"Biomedical Instrumentation"},{"text":"Medical Imaging"},{"text":"Biomaterials"},{"text":"Biosensors"},{"text":"Biomedical Signal Processing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical and laboratory skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Wet-lab skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the research laboratory:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pipetting"},{"text":"Buffer preparation"},{"text":"Centrifugation"},{"text":"Spectrophotometry"},{"text":"Chromatography"},{"text":"Electrophoresis"},{"text":"PCR/qPCR concepts"},{"text":"Cell culture"},{"text":"Microscopy"},{"text":"Protein purification"},{"text":"ELISA"},{"text":"Basic molecular-biology workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Biophysical techniques"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the principles and interpretation of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UV-Vis spectroscopy"},{"text":"Fluorescence spectroscopy"},{"text":"FTIR"},{"text":"Circular dichroism"},{"text":"NMR concepts"},{"text":"X-ray crystallography concepts"},{"text":"Cryo-EM concepts"},{"text":"Mass spectrometry"},{"text":"Surface plasmon resonance"},{"text":"Atomic force microscopy"},{"text":"Dynamic light scattering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computational skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"h","text":"R"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Biostatistics"},{"text":"Visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Bioinformatics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NCBI"},{"text":"BLAST"},{"text":"UniProt"},{"text":"PDB"},{"text":"EMBL-EBI"},{"text":"Bioconductor"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research computing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"SQL basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 5–7 research-oriented projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Protein structure and stability analysis"},{"text":"Molecular docking study"},{"text":"Biomedical image-analysis project"},{"text":"Protein/biomolecule sequence analysis"},{"text":"Drug–target interaction analysis"},{"text":"Biophysical analysis of a biomolecule"},{"text":"Biomedical dataset statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong project should follow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Scientific question","hypothesis","method","data","statistical analysis","interpretation","limitations","conclusion"]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not make every project an AI/ML project. Demonstrate that you understand the underlying biology and physical principles."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Molecular Biophysics"},{"text":"Protein structure, spectroscopy, thermodynamics"},{"text":"Research labs"},{"text":"Biophysics Researcher"}],[{"text":"Structural Biology"},{"text":"Cryo-EM, crystallography, molecular modelling"},{"text":"Structural-biology labs"},{"text":"Structural Biologist"}],[{"text":"Computational Biophysics"},{"text":"Python, simulations, molecular dynamics"},{"text":"Computational projects"},{"text":"Computational Biophysicist"}],[{"text":"Biomedical Imaging"},{"text":"Image processing, microscopy, physics"},{"text":"Imaging labs"},{"text":"Biomedical Imaging Scientist"}],[{"text":"Biomechanics"},{"text":"Mechanics, modelling, simulation"},{"text":"Biomedical research"},{"text":"Biomechanics Scientist"}],[{"text":"Bioinformatics"},{"text":"Python/R, databases, statistics"},{"text":"NCBI/EBI"},{"text":"Bioinformatics Scientist"}],[{"text":"Biosensors"},{"text":"Sensors, biochemistry, materials"},{"text":"Biomedical labs"},{"text":"Biosensor Researcher"}],[{"text":"Drug Discovery"},{"text":"Structural biology, docking, computational chemistry"},{"text":"Drug-discovery research"},{"text":"Drug Discovery Scientist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Biomedical research is becoming increasingly quantitative. Build toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biology","Physics","Quantitative Analysis","Scientific Computing","AI","Advanced Instrumentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI and computational methods will increasingly support protein modelling, drug discovery, biomedical imaging and experimental design, but researchers must still understand experimental controls, biological mechanisms, statistical assumptions and limitations."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / research"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"AIIMS","url":"https://www.aiims.edu/"},{"text":"Biomedical and clinical research"}],[{"text":"ICMR","url":"https://www.icmr.gov.in/"},{"text":"Biomedical and health research"}],[{"text":"National Institute of Immunology","url":"https://www.nii.res.in/"},{"text":"Molecular and biomedical research"}],[{"text":"Centre for Cellular and Molecular Biology","url":"https://www.ccmb.res.in/"},{"text":"Molecular biology and biomedical research"}],[{"text":"National Centre for Biological Sciences","url":"https://www.ncbs.res.in/"},{"text":"Biological and quantitative research"}],[{"text":"Indian Institute of Science","url":"https://iisc.ac.in/"},{"text":"Biophysics and interdisciplinary research"}],[{"text":"Department of Biotechnology","url":"https://dbtindia.gov.in/"},{"text":"Biotechnology research ecosystem"}],[{"text":"CSIR","url":"https://www.csir.res.in/"},{"text":"Biomedical, chemical and biological research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private / industry"},{"type":"p"