hips"},{"text":"Academic + English requirements"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong biology/physics/chemistry grades"},{"text":"Research experience"},{"text":"Laboratory skills"},{"text":"Computational portfolio"},{"text":"Research project/dissertation"},{"text":"Academic recommendations"},{"text":"SOP/research statement"},{"text":"GitHub where relevant"},{"text":"Research poster/paper contribution where available"},{"text":"English-language test where required"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","Research Associate / Project Assistant","PhD Researcher","Postdoctoral Researcher","Scientist","Senior Scientist","Principal Scientist / Research Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Academic route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","M.Sc.","PhD","Postdoc","Assistant Professor","Associate Professor","Professor"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD research areas"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible specialisations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Molecular Biophysics"},{"text":"Structural Biology"},{"text":"Computational Biophysics"},{"text":"Biomedical Imaging"},{"text":"Biomechanics"},{"text":"Systems Biology"},{"text":"Protein Science"},{"text":"Drug Discovery"},{"text":"Bioinformatics"},{"text":"Biosensors"},{"text":"Biomaterials"},{"text":"Nanobiotechnology"},{"text":"Cancer Biophysics"},{"text":"Neurobiophysics"},{"text":"Quantitative Biology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile will combine deep biological understanding, quantitative physical reasoning, advanced laboratory methods and computational research. Researchers who can bridge wet-lab experiments with modelling, imaging, bioinformatics and AI will be particularly well positioned."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended target by graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"Aim to have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1–2 research internships"},{"text":"1 substantial undergraduate research project"},{"text":"5+ biomedical/biophysics projects"},{"text":"Strong Python + scientific computing"},{"text":"Basic R/statistics"},{"text":"Linux + Git"},{"text":"Strong biology + physics fundamentals"},{"text":"Laboratory experience"},{"text":"Exposure to microscopy/spectroscopy"},{"text":"At least one computational biology project"},{"text":"At least one biomedical imaging/data project"},{"text":"Research poster/presentation where possible"},{"text":"Strong academic recommendations"},{"text":"Research-focused CV"},{"text":"Clear M.Sc./PhD pathway"}]}]}]}